# Netlify domain-level redirects for the two alias domains -> primary domain.
# Add BOTH alias domains in Netlify's Domain settings first, then this rule
# 301-redirects them here. (On Cloudflare Pages, do this instead via
# Bulk Redirects or a custom domain + "Redirect Rules" in the dashboard —
# this file has no effect there.)
https://keratinhairelmwoodpark.com/*   https://keratintreatmentelmwoodpark.com/:splat   301!
https://elmwoodparkkeratin.com/*        https://keratintreatmentelmwoodpark.com/:splat   301!
